  "notes": "Weekly rate: $375 for Westchester County residents, $425 for non-residents. Hours 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. Campers may attend at most three weeks. Groups: Leaping Frogs (grades 1 to 2), Soaring Eagles (grades 3 to 4), Clever Coyotes (grades 5 to 6), Conservationists in Training (grades 7 to 9, July 27 to 31 only). Weekly themes: Insects and Invertebrates, Marvelous Mammals, Earth Elements, All About Birds, Plant Power, Beneath Your Feet.",
